    26	   `:536,:542,:543` (sentiment trend), `:208,:211,:213` (velocity), `:333`
    27	   (rating breakdown); `aggregate-queries.ts:198,:199` (velocity), `:214`
    28	   (rating breakdown). **Do NOT touch:** response rate
    29	   (`service.ts:451-485`, `aggregate-queries.ts:163-169` — workflow KPI, stays
    30	   `detected_at` per ADR 0019 D2), timeSaved (`service.ts:508-525`, keys on
