    32	3. **Delete the orphan pair:** `getLocationKpiSummary` + `getAccountKpiSummary`
    33	   (`kpi/service.ts`) and `src/app/api/dashboard/kpis/route.ts` + their tests.
    34	   Zero consumers, verified three ways. **Keep `src/lib/kpi/types.ts`** — 9
    35	   importers of the window vocabulary; it and `fragments.ts` become the
