   174	// ── Agent run spine (WS1) ────────────────────────────────────────────
   175	// Starts (or joins) the review_handler run for a review and records the
   176	// ingest/update step, inside the SAME transaction as the review write —
   177	// outbox discipline: a spine failure fails the job and BullMQ retries.
   178	// Unchanged/status-only paths deliberately get no spine writes (mirrors
