   459	 * reply. status='posted', all three text columns set to the canonicalized
   460	 * reply, llm_* columns NULL (no LLM call produced this row).
   461	 *
   462	 * version is computed server-side as `COALESCE(MAX(version), 0) + 1` so prior
   463	 * terminal rows ('failed', 'superseded') don't collide on the
   464	 * (review_id, version) unique constraint.
