docs/sass_ready/README.md:111:- **Wave 3 — Visibility & AI safety**: `07` observability (JSON logs, Next.js `/api/health`, Bull Board) · `22` AI ops (**pin the OpenAI model — 1 line**, eval set, moderation) + `10` trust/safety · `11` KPIs + sentiment · `26` finance rollup. **✅ SHIPPED to main (2026-05-27, 6-PR slice all merged; production vendor gates pending). Verified 2026-05-27: working tree clean, all four CI gates green (lint 0-error, typecheck, 4232 tests pass, build), `pnpm eval:llm` 8/8 offline, migration head 052.** **Merged as a stacked PR set:** `07` observability spine (PR #93 — JSON structured logs + `AsyncLocalStorage` context, web/worker `/api/health`, admin queue counts, typed analytics taxonomy + CI drift audit, on-call runbooks; **Bull Board deferred**); `22` AI audit foundation (PR #94, migration 050 — pinned OpenAI model + regression guard, versioned/hashed prompt base, `api_costs` prompt/latency/account/moderation metadata, prompt-injection hardening); `10` moderation backend + admin flagged queue (PRs #95/#96 + the owner-path hold-binding fix #98, migration 051 — local output filter + optional OpenAI moderation, `flagged_responses` hold with the no-auto-posting invariant preserved, `/admin/flagged` disposition). **Then merged:** `22`/`10` launch-critical LLM eval harness (`tests/llm-eval/*`, runs keyless) + trust-safety enforcement docs (`docs/trust-safety/*`) (PR #99); `11` deterministic review sentiment + 8-week sentiment trend (PR #100, migration 052) and the customer KPI query layer + `GET /api/dashboard/kpis` (PR #105 — resubmit of auto-closed #101); `26` admin API/LLM cost-margin signals (aggregate-on-read from `api_costs`, surfaced in `/admin/costs`) + COGS/monthly-close/three-scenario-model finance docs (`docs/finance/*`) (PR #102); living-docs pass for PRs 4–6 (PR #104). Design: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-26-wave-3-visibility-ai-safety-design.md`; per-PR plans in `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-26-wave-3-pr*.md`. **External gates (not code):** Bull Board, production log drain + Sentry P0–P2 routing + synthetic checks, `OPENAI_MODERATION_ENABLED` + threshold tuning, scheduled 50-row live eval, PostHog production dashboards + `POSTHOG_API_KEY` delivery, dashboard KPI cards + CSV export (UI follow-up), ProfitWell / Stripe Revenue Recognition / QuickBooks-Xero + first monthly close, first COGS file from real invoices.
