     1	# Spec 11 — Data, Analytics & BI
     2	
     3	> **Goal:** Five customer-facing KPIs on dashboard home, per-location + roll-up reporting, PostHog as the internal BI source through $500k ARR, single source-of-truth event taxonomy.
     4	
     5	> **🟢 Implementation status (Wave 3, 2026-05-27):** LAUNCH SLICE CODE-COMPLETE (backend). **Done (PR #100, merged to main, migration 052):** deterministic per-review sentiment (`reviews.sentiment_*`, star-based `classifySentiment`, one-time back-fill). **Done (PR #105, merged to main — resubmit of auto-closed #101):** the five launch KPIs as a dedicated `DashboardKpiSummary` (response rate, avg star, review-volume MoM, avg time-to-respond, 8-week sentiment trend) in `src/lib/kpi/*`, scoped per-location + per-account; served read-only by `GET /api/dashboard/kpis` (auth + IDOR + subscription read-entitlement + scope-UUID validation). PostHog dashboard definitions in `docs/analytics/posthog-dashboards.md`; the typed event taxonomy + CI drift audit shipped in PR #93. Verified 2026-05-27 (CI green, KPI route IDOR + subscription gate confirmed in `route.ts`). **Deferred:** the visible dashboard KPI **cards** (UI follow-up) and CSV/PDF export; production PostHog dashboards + Metabase/read-replica remain external/later.
