     8	
     9	## 1. Why this matters
    10	
    11	Multi-location customers buy on reporting polish. Internal BI is how the founder makes non-anecdotal decisions. Both depend on a documented event taxonomy that doesn't drift — drift is the silent killer of analytics trust.
    12	
    13	## 2. Current state (RepWorth)
    14	
    15	_Verified 2026-05-23 against the live tree (migration head 042)._
    16	
    17	- Owner dashboard redesigned (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-07-owner-dashboard-redesign.md`) — **already renders customer-facing KPI cards** (`KpiCards.tsx`, plus Velocity/Ranking/IntelligenceBrief cards). Some of this spec's "5 KPIs" likely already exist; reconcile before rebuilding.
    18	- An **internal KPI dashboard already exists** at `src/app/admin/overview` (`/api/admin/overview/route.ts`) computing metrics **directly from Postgres** (pending outbox, failed jobs, cost/day, email health, response rate, churn-risk via `computeChurnRiskScore`). This is the de-facto internal BI today — there is no PostHog.
    19	- Multi-location schema (migration 034) supports per-location roll-up.
    20	- **No PostHog yet** (decided Step 0, install pending — see [Spec 01](./01-product-market-fit.md) §2a). PostHog is the BI spine; Metabase-on-replica is the later scale option (see §Future). No `docs/analytics/events.md`, no data warehouse.
    21	- **No sentiment classifier.** `reviews` has `star_rating` but **no sentiment column**; `mock-generator.ts`'s `classifySentiment()` only maps stars → template pools (not a real classifier).
    22	
    23	## 3. Target state
    24	
    25	### Customer-facing dashboard — 5 KPIs on home
    26	| KPI | Definition | Time window |
    27	|---|---|---|
    28	| Response rate | `published_responses / received_reviews` | Last 30 days |
    29	| Average star rating | `AVG(reviews.star)` | Last 30 days |
    30	| Review volume MoM | (`this_month_count - last_month_count) / last_month_count` | Calendar month |
    31	| Avg time-to-respond | `AVG(published_at - received_at)` | Last 30 days |
    32	| Sentiment trend | Weekly sentiment score from LLM classifier; trend arrow vs. prior week | Last 8 weeks |
    33	
    34	- Per-location filter on Growth+ tier.
