    40	> Today, internal BI is the Postgres-direct `admin/overview` dashboard. PostHog becomes the spine below; Metabase-on-replica is the later scale option once custom-SQL needs exceed PostHog (see §Future), not a replacement.
    41	- Cohorts (signup week, vertical, ICP-fit score).
    42	- Retention curves split by activation.
