    49	- Set up **Metabase + Supabase read-replica** when custom SQL needs exceed PostHog (likely at $250k ARR).
    50	- Skip BigQuery + dbt + Fivetran until $500k ARR or a serious data hire.
    51	
    52	### Event taxonomy
    53	**Single source of truth: `docs/analytics/events.md`.**
    54	
    55	Standard schema:
    56	```yaml
    57	- name: response_published
    58	  description: A response was published to Google after owner approval
    59	  fired_from: worker/jobs/publisher/publish.ts
    60	  properties:
    61	    - account_id: uuid (required)
    62	    - business_id: uuid (required)
